# Cloudflare analytics token (Brief 57). A live credential handed over as a file — it was in the
# working tree UNIGNORED and untracked, which is one `git add -A` from being in history forever.
# Broad patterns, because the next one will not be named exactly this.
analytics_token*
*analytics_token*
*_token.txt
*.token
